    <briefdescription>
<para>As <ref refid="structck__constraint" kindref="compound">ck_constraint</ref> object depends on <ref refid="structspace__def" kindref="compound">space_def</ref> we must rebuild all ck constraints on space alter. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>To perform it transactionally, we create a list of new ck constraint objects in ::prepare method that is fault-tolerant. Finally in ::alter or ::rollback methods we only swap those lists securely. </para>    </detaileddescription>
